---
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<section id="about" class="border-b border-line" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-4">
      <h2
        id="about-heading"
        class="font-serif text-3xl tracking-tight text-ink"
      >
        About
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-[1.05rem] text-muted lg:col-span-8">
      <p>
        I am a Full-Stack Engineer in Rabat. Since September 2024 I have been a
        Mendix consultant at DXC Technology / ADD, delivering enterprise
        applications with Mendix, Java, Spring Boot and React — custom widgets
        and JavaScript actions on the front, microflows, Java actions, REST and
        OData on the back.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before that I spent two years at Inetum as a study and development
        engineer: Java and Spring microservices, Angular interfaces,
        containerisation with Docker, Keycloak, and Mendix. I trained as a Data
        &amp; Software Engineer at INSEA, spent an exchange year in Artificial
        Intelligence at Université Laval, and interned in data science at Beneva
        in Québec.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of the public work on my GitHub is backend-shaped: how a domain
        splits into services, what belongs on a request path, and what belongs
        on a broker. I still build the front ends.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 pt-2 font-mono text-sm">
        {
          site.languages.map((lang) => (
            <li>
              <span class="text-ink">{lang.name}</span>
              <span class="text-muted"> — {lang.level}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
